    "turn_text": "Thank you. You know, I know it's the same with you all. We have a hurricane, and unfortunately, we're also practiced. We know how to do it, how to respond, how to prepare, how to recover, and this one's very different. It really is. We certainly have more that our share of disaster experience in Louisiana, and some of that has been helpful. But I think everybody is just trying to do what they can to try and help our community members that are really impacted by this. This has just been incredible.",
