    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74498.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "So one of the things we always like to say about Louisiana is we're feeding and fueling the nation, right? So I want to pivot just a second to one of Jacques and I's favorite subjects, which is food and seafood. So Garrett, please tell us a little bit more about your work with USDA on shrimp and now crawfish, as I understand it.",
