    "turn_idx": 72,
    "turn_text": "Yeah. Thank you so much, Congressman, for being on and for everything you've done for Louisiana and our coast. And speaking of our coast, it's time for the Coastal Voice of the Week. And this week is from Helen in Baton Rouge. And Helen says, I love our beautiful coastline and we need to stop the erosion that is happening. before we lose the foundation of land here in Louisiana. So you couldn't agree more, Helen. You can go to restorethecoast.org and share your perspective. And we might just read it on the show one day. So another great episode of a land yacht episode with the Congressman. So huge thanks to Congressman Graves for making this happen. And we'll be back on our next episode on Delta dispatches. See you later, alligators.",
